          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Likeability.ST_Likeability",
          "Key": "chat_dai_a_1",
          "SourceString": "【At.1】注意！I级异象「苦蛋糕」在桥间地爆发，如果吃下的蛋糕是苦的请不要因此跟商家产生冲突，这并不是商家的错，如遇到这种情况，本人建议大家一定要心平气和地沟通，这样才能得到大家都满意的结果。",
          "LocalizedString": "[At.1] Alert! Class I Anomaly Bittercake has occurred in Bridge Crossings. If you encounter cakes that taste bitter, please do not confront the vendors, as this is not their fault. In such cases, I strongly advise everyone to communicate calmly and rationally to reach a resolution that satisfies all parties."
        },
