        "bIsImmediatelyShow": true,
        "ChatItemType": "ELikeabilityChatItemType::Normal",
        "Content": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Likeability.ST_Likeability",
          "Key": "chat_dai_a_2",
          "SourceString": "【Tips】桥间地的居民朋友们，你们好。I级异象「苦蛋糕」已经在桥间地出现了一段时间了，希望它没有为各位居民的生活造成太大的影响。在这里，本人要提醒大家，本次「苦蛋糕」很有可能会造成I级异象「幽灵们的蛋糕盛宴」出现，而它的出现会让各位通过「苦蛋糕」消除压力的居民朋友们重新感受到压力，希望大家能做好相应的心理准备。同时，本人建议大家寻找一些其他的方式来排解压力，比如在工作的下午抽出十几分钟享受一份香甜的下午茶，或许要比依赖「苦蛋糕」更好。",
          "LocalizedString": "[Tips] Greetings, residents of Bridge Crossings. The Class I Anomaly Bittercake has been present in Bridge Crossings for some time now, and I hope it hasn't significantly impacted your daily lives. I must warn everyone that this Bittercake incident may trigger the Ghastly Cakefest as well, which is another Class I Anomaly, causing residents who have been relieving stress through Bittercake to experience renewed pressure. Please be prepared for this possibility. Meanwhile, I suggest finding alternative methods of stress relief. For instance, taking a fifteen-minute break in the afternoon to enjoy some sweet afternoon tea might be better than relying on Bittercake."
        },
