        "Content": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Likeability.ST_Likeability",
          "Key": "chat_dai_a_3",
          "SourceString": "【At.1】注意！在桥间地郊区有大量「原核体」出现，各位市民朋友请在异象管理局发布正式通知之前不要靠近「原核体」出现区域！同时因为「原核体」的出现，部分车辆被困在了那片区域，本人呼吁有余力的异象猎人前往协助异象管理局泯除异象，完成后也可向现场的负责人领取奖励！在此，本人向为了海特洛市民的生命财产安全做出贡献的异象猎人们表达诚挚的感谢！",
          "LocalizedString": "[At.1] Alert! A surge of Protocores has been detected in the Bridge Crossings suburbs. Citizens are advised to stay away from areas where Protocores have been spotted until an official notice is issued by the Bureau of Anomaly Control! Due to Protocore presence, several vehicles are stranded in the affected area. We call upon available anomaly hunters to assist the Bureau of Anomaly Control with nullification operations. Rewards can be claimed from the on-site supervisor after completion! On behalf of Hethereau, I extend my sincere gratitude to all anomaly hunters who contribute to protecting the lives and property of our citizens."
        },
