        "Content": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Likeability.ST_Likeability",
          "Key": "chat_dai_a_4",
          "SourceString": "【At.1】注意！I级异象「幽灵们的蛋糕盛宴」在桥间地店铺「爱丽丝烘焙店」出现了！本人非常遗憾地告诉大家，因为异象的影响，这家深受桥间地市民喜爱的蛋糕店被迫暂时关闭……不过，异象管理局目前正在全力解决异象中，相信很快就能把各位市民喜爱的蛋糕带回大家的身边！",
          "LocalizedString": "[At.1] Alert! Class I Anomaly Ghastly Cakefest has appeared at Alice's Bakery in Bridge Crossings! It is with great regret that I must inform everyone that due to the effects of this anomaly, this beloved bakery of Bridge Crossings has been temporarily closed… However, the Bureau of Anomaly Control is currently working at full capacity to resolve this anomaly, and we believe we'll soon be able to bring back the cakes that our citizens love!"
        },
