        "Content": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Common.ST_Common",
          "Key": "dai_b_1",
          "SourceString": "尊敬的{0}：\r\n您所申请的《幽灵号乘客守则》讲解课程，本人已为您预约完毕。\r\n请您尽早前往就近的幽灵号站点参加课程。\r\n本人衷心祝愿您学习顺利，在笔试中取得佳绩！\r\n异象管理局 袋先生",
          "LocalizedString": "Dear {0},\r\nI have finished arranging your briefing session for the Ghost Train Passenger Manual.\r\nPlease proceed to your nearest Ghost Train station to attend the session at your earliest convenience.\r\nI sincerely wish you successful learning and excellent test results!\r\nMr. Bag, Bureau of Anomaly Control"
        },
